  ('harvest.dry_lb_per_plant_vs_plan_pct', 'bizops', 'bizops,farmops', 'Yield per plant vs plan', 'Rendimiento por planta vs plan', 'pct', 'daily', '09-01', '10-31', 'strain,farm', 'field_estimates', 'estimateInForce', 'at_least', 'buildStrainPerformance dryLbPerPlant and estimatePerPlant (src/strainperformance.ts:264-268, :284-287, :312, :332); variance and percent are new columns; unloaded lots with no dry grams excluded; farm grain = HTD dry PPP over dried lots against the estimate in force weighted by those lots'' plant counts per strain', 'app', 30, 'live', 1, 'Plan source (debate plan_source); wet or dry', 'Fuente del plan (debate plan_source); húmedo o seco', 'dd_plan_source', NULL, '15', 290, 1, '2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z'),
